Subject: [PATCH] arm64: tegra_linux_defconfig: build the iSCSI initiator

Build iscsi_tcp (and libiscsi, iscsi transport) as modules, as Lakka does.
Needs the libiscsi_tcp build fix.
---
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/tegra_linux_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/tegra_linux_defconfig
@@ -419,6 +419,7 @@
 CONFIG_TEGRA_PROFILER=y
 # CONFIG_EVENTLIB is not set
 CONFIG_SCSI=y
+CONFIG_ISCSI_TCP=m
 CONFIG_BLK_DEV_SD=y
 CONFIG_BLK_DEV_SR=m
 CONFIG_BLK_DEV_SR_VENDOR=y
